Findings  x 0 errors | ! 30 warnings | 0 info

   1  ! NODE_ENV is set in negative/.env.development but not documented in any
        template
        warning | EG002 undocumented-variable | negative/.env.development:2:1

      Why      Teammates, CI and deploy targets learn which variables exist from
               the templates; without an entry, NODE_ENV will be missing
               wherever this file is not copied.
      Fix      Add `NODE_ENV=` (with an empty or placeholder value, never the
               real one) to negative/.env.example, or remove it from
               negative/.env.development if nothing uses it.

