  11  ! DEBUG must be false in production but is on (positive/.env.production)
        warning | EG015 unsafe-production-value | positive/.env.production:1:7

      Why      The schema (.envguard.yaml:14) constrains DEBUG in production;
               violating it usually means a development or test setting is about
               to be deployed.
      Fix      Set `DEBUG=false` in positive/.env.production.
      Related  .envguard.yaml:14:3

  12  ! APP_DEBUG is set in positive/.env.production but not documented in any
        template
        warning | EG002 undocumented-variable | positive/.env.production:2:1

      Why      Teammates, CI and deploy targets learn which variables exist from
