  13  ! APP_DEBUG is enabled in production (positive/.env.production)
        warning | EG015 unsafe-production-value | positive/.env.production:2:11

      Why      Laravel debug mode in production exposes stack traces, settings
               and sometimes an interactive console to anyone who triggers an
               error.
      Fix      Set `APP_DEBUG=false` in positive/.env.production.

