  19  ! NODE_ENV is development, but production must use "production"
        (positive/.env.production)
        warning | EG015 unsafe-production-value | positive/.env.production:5:10

      Why      Frameworks switch off caching, minification and security defaults
               outside "production", and some enable verbose errors.
      Fix      Set `NODE_ENV=production` in positive/.env.production.

