  23  ! APP_ENV is local in production (positive/.env.production)
        warning | EG015 unsafe-production-value | positive/.env.production:7:9

      Why      Laravel and similar frameworks enable development behavior (debug
               pages, relaxed security) for local and development environments.
      Fix      Set `APP_ENV=production` in positive/.env.production.

  24  ! DATABASE_URL is set in positive/.env.production but not documented in
