  25  ! DATABASE_URL points to a local address in production
        (positive/.env.production)
        warning | EG015 unsafe-production-value | positive/.env.production:8:14

      Why      Inside a production container or server, localhost is the machine
               itself, not your database or API; this is almost always a
               development value that slipped through.
      Fix      Set DATABASE_URL in positive/.env.production to the production
               host.

