  28  ! LOG_LEVEL must not be debug in production (positive/.env.production)
        warning | EG015 unsafe-production-value | positive/.env.production:10:11

      Why      The schema (.envguard.yaml:4) constrains LOG_LEVEL in production;
               violating it usually means a development or test setting is about
               to be deployed.
      Fix      Change LOG_LEVEL in positive/.env.production to a
               production-appropriate value.
      Related  .envguard.yaml:4:3

  29  ! CACHE_ENABLED must be true in production but is no
        (positive/.env.production)
        warning | EG015 unsafe-production-value | positive/.env.production:11:15

      Why      The schema (.envguard.yaml:8) constrains CACHE_ENABLED in
               production; violating it usually means a development or test
               setting is about to be deployed.
      Fix      Set `CACHE_ENABLED=true` in positive/.env.production.
      Related  .envguard.yaml:8:3

  30  ! CDN_URL does not match the production pattern "^https://"
        (positive/.env.production)
        warning | EG015 unsafe-production-value | positive/.env.production:12:9

      Why      The schema (.envguard.yaml:11) constrains CDN_URL in production;
               violating it usually means a development or test setting is about
               to be deployed.
      Fix      Set CDN_URL in positive/.env.production to a value matching
               "^https://".
      Related  .envguard.yaml:11:3

